      "date": "2026-06-02T11:35:16.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹676 (vs ₹56.24 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹676 (up from ₹56.24 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹556.3m (up 86% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹66.6m (up ₹61.1m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 12% (up from 1.9% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 24% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
