      "date": "2026-06-01T11:40:54.000Z",
      "title": "Insufficient new directors",
      "body": "No new directors have joined the board in the last 3 years. The company's board is composed of: No new directors. 1 experienced director. 3 highly experienced directors. Independent Director Anil Wani was the last director to join the board, commencing their role in 2023. The company’s insufficient board refreshment is considered a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
